    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "brown meat (crab)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "茹でたての毛ガニの甲羅にたっぷり詰まったカニ味噌を、熱燗に入れて飲むのが冬の贅沢だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「うーん、このカニ味噌の濃厚なコクは、一度食べたら病みつきになっちゃうね」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "寿司屋で軍艦巻きのカニ味噌を注文し、磯の香りと独特の苦味をじっくりと堪能した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "蒸し器から上がったばかりの渡り蟹を割り、中から溢れ出す熱々のカニ味噌をスプーンで掬い取った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "miso mixed with crab innards or scraps",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「うわっ、このカニ味噌、濃厚で日本酒が止まらなくなるね。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "甲羅の中でグツグツと焼かれたカニ味噌の香ばしさが、店内に広がっている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "贅沢にカニの身をほぐし、たっぷりのカニ味噌と和えていただくのが一番の楽しみだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「カニ味噌は見た目で敬遠してたけど、一度食べたら病みつきになっちゃった。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
